                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "America\u2019s broken permitting process doesn\u2019t just slow the deployment of new energy. From affordable housing to even treatment centers for veterans, I\u2019ve seen firsthand how the system limits us from building the things we need.\n\nI enjoyed speaking with @RepWesterman at @NCEWConf  about the human cost of America\u2019s permitting system \u2014 and how our bipartisan SPEED Act can fix it.",
